  "tip": "<p>When spikes are brief focus on controlling concurrency and smoothing retries. Look for <i>connection pooling</i> to cap sessions and <i>exponential backoff with jitter</i> to avoid retry storms rather than changes that only affect storage or notifications.</p>",
